B.abf=s(["Tap to post a new job from your home screen.","Pick a saved vehicle, or add a new one (make, model, year).","Enter the service address: where the work will happen. YCYC uses it to send your job to mechanics within about 100 miles.","Describe the problem: noises, warning lights, when it started, anything you have already tried. More detail means better, more accurate bids.","Optional: add photos or a quote you already have from a shop.","Tap 'Post for bids'."],t.s)
B.a01=new A.hq(B.abf)
B.YX=new A.e_("Mechanics only see your zip code while bidding. Your full address is shown only to the mechanic you choose, and only after your payment is secured.")
