B.a_6=new A.b0("A mechanic who arrives late is not a no-show. You can let the job go ahead, or cancel; a normal cancellation fee applies if you cancel after paying. If you are unhappy about repeated lateness, tell us with 'Report a concern' and leave an honest review.")
