B.X3=new A.bd("c-disputes-refunds","Refunds: how they work","Refunds are not guaranteed. Decided case by case, based on evidence.",B.aaN)
B.a8k=s(["Do not release payment while an issue is open.","Collect evidence: dated photos or video, the part or invoice if relevant, and notes of what was agreed and what happened.","Tap 'Report a concern' on the job, or email rayconsumerlabs@gmail.com, and describe: what you expected, what happened, and what you would like us to consider.","Reply promptly and truthfully if we ask questions."],t.s)
B.a07=new A.hq(B.a8k)
