B.anc=new A.fD(4,B.dM,"The mechanic comes and diagnoses","Same arrival steps as any YCYC job.",!1,null)
B.and=new A.fD(1,B.f6,"What YCYC is","\"Your Car, Your Choice\" is a marketplace where independent, local mechanics compete for your repair job by bidding on it \u2014 you're never stuck with a single shop's price.",!1,null)
B.ane=new A.fD(5,B.jR,"You get the diagnosis in writing","It shows up in the app, and we let you know.",!1,null)
B.anf=new A.fD(3,B.qT,"Built by a mechanic","YCYC was founded by a former mechanic who has spent years teaching people in underserved neighborhoods how to work on their own cars \u2014 this app runs on that same idea: give people real options and straight answers.",!1,null)
B.ang=new A.fD(2,B.qY,"Mechanics bid hours","Each one tells you how many hours and their rate, and the total.",!1,null)
B.anh=new A.fD(4,B.ii,"How it works","Describe your issue (or upload a quote you already have), get competing bids from real mechanics, and pay securely \u2014 your payment is only released once the work is actually done.",!0,null)
B.ani=new A.fD(5,B.dM,"Your mechanic arrives","Follow them on the map or ask them to share their location. Your name stays private until they arrive. Confirm when they start. Any extra work needs your approval first.",!1,null)
